  "sourceTitle": "Corn Beef Brisket",
  "sourceText": "Corn Beef Brisket\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 18, 2009 - 11:32pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 - 4 lb. brisket\n2 oranges, sliced\n2 onions, sliced\n4 celery sticks, cut in halves\n2 garlics, in quarters\n2 bay leaves\n2 teaspoons dill seed\n1 teaspoon rosemary\n12 whole cloves\n6 whole sticks cinnamon\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Arrange half seasonings on heavy aluminum foil. Place meat on top. Add remaining seasonings. Seal foil. Place in shallow pan. Bake 3 1/2 - 4 hours until tender in 325 degree oven. Do not open until done.",
